<title>COLOMBIA: SOCCER-LANUS WIN CONMEBOL CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LANUS WIN CONMEBOL CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe (Colombia) beat Lanus</p>
<p>(Argentina) 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in the second leg of the South</p>
<p>American Conmebol Cup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Francisco Whittingham (3rd minute, penalty)</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>Lanus win 2-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
